<h1>How to enable Creator mode for your account</h1>
<h2>Activation</h2>
<p>The first step of enabling Creator mode, is activating Creator mode.<br>You can do so <a href="../../streamer/activate" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>
<img src="../../i/g/how_to_enable_creator_and_use_modules/img0.png" alt="activation screen">
<h2>Creator configuration</h2>
<p>After you have agreed to our terms and clicked 'enable' you will be greeted by our configuration screen. <br>Here you will be required to add a small and normal description for your account. <br>These can be seen your Creator page your viewers will use.</p>
<img src="../../i/g/how_to_enable_creator_and_use_modules/img1.png" alt="setup screen">
<p>After clicking 'done', you will be redirected to the Creator dashboard.</p>
